# 统一行尾：仓库内一律存 LF；检出时交给 core.autocrlf 处理，避免每次 add 都刷
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，也避免跨机器产生纯行尾 diff。
* text=auto

# 跨平台读取的脚本与数据：检出也保持 LF
*.py    text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf

# 文档：仓库内 LF，检出按平台
*.md    text

# 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.prt   binary
*.asm   binary
*.winch binary
*.gph   binary
